abstract: >-
  RAFAELIA is a 295KB / 6,432-line source stack delivering an
  end-to-end pipeline from human speech to ARM64/x86_64 assembly,
  validated on real hardware (Motorola E7 Power, Cortex-A55).
  It includes a FALA→LOW-LEVEL compiler over 7 languages, a
  freestanding C runtime (32 opcodes, 16KB binary), a cognitive
  kernel implementing the ψχρΔΣΩ cycle, and a multilingual
  biblical corpus pre-compiled with gematria, bytecode, and
  assembly. Build-reproducible with deterministic SHA256.
